{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-09-28 09:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN COMMITS $400,000 TO COMBAT FOOD INSECURITY', 'text': "GRANTS WILL SUPPORT 31 FOOD BANKS ACROSS THE COMPANY'S 22-STATE NETWORK ATLANTA , SEPT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED A COMMITMENT OF $400,000 IN GRANTS TO 31 FOOD BANKS LOCATED ACROSS THE STATES SERVED BY THE COMPANY."}